ong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","review_id":"SV-UVpuTxEbnRdY7R6w7xg","date":"2016-06-02T17:39:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.926111102104187,"text_excerpt":"I had a birthday party here, and it was so much fun. The food was exceptionally good quality for bar food. The servers were very accommodating and friendly. Even if you want to watch a game I would recommend it! They have the best pizza in the French Quarter, and from what I've been told the best steak too. The cheeseburger pizza is to die for, so I would put that on the top of my list to try if you decide to visit!"},{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","review_id":"kLaTr43d6zMUL617fn-20w","date":"2018-11-17T13:16:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9246233105659485,"text_excerpt":"This place has great late night bar food. The pizza and nachos never disappoint. This place doesn't look like much and to call it a dive is being kind but I have been here several times and I have always been happy with what I have ordered. Plus, they deliver. I ordered a pizza at 10:30 on a Friday night and it was at my door in 25 minutes."},{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","review_id":"uz3AiuQMknnN48x4sSR3XA","date":"2016-05-21T18:01:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9242035150527954,"text_excerpt":"This is our go to place for late night food. Open 24 hours , I think. Plus they say they deliver. Pizza is really good !! They have a good 20 oz ribeye steak. 16.95. With a small potatoe skin and toast. Wings, Caesar Salad and artichoke dip, are all good as well. I use to enjoy the nachos. But not so much now, as they have made them smaller, to fit on a fajita skillet. So they are hard to eat, and all the toppings are on top, so when you get down to the middle, yep...out of toppings. It's a solid place, near market Square. Lots of locals, as it's far from Bourbon."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","photo_id":"D5gK0jq7m5Q62Qow2HXrHQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/D5gK0jq7m5Q62Qow2HXrHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8889884948730469},{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","photo_id":"CDmbMgQvAuyXcR3xiLCjoA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CDmbMgQvAuyXcR3xiLCjoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8822605609893799},{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","photo_id":"nKqEnIKOdQS6q5l4iJlSnw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nKqEnIKOdQS6q5l4iJlSnw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8275609016418457},{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","photo_id":"OBYQjjDb8MyBPjOBVcolTA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OBYQjjDb8MyBPjOBVcolTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8067977428436279},{"business_id":"ALjOBKvlyT-lcLFihD4P8g","photo_id":"k-7fhNXFtHXFEIB2Ip4UpA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/k-7fhNXFtHXFEIB2Ip4UpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7743691802024841}]},"notebook_case":nul